{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mewts is a top-down party game for up to 4 players online or local. In the centre of the game are intense competitive game modes where you fight it out as these silly creatures</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRETCHY WORMS</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ede6af21a2b0bbaa48c01d67c03fb49d.poster.avif?t=1755589106\" width=500 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ede6af21a2b0bbaa48c01d67c03fb49d.webm?t=1755589106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/ede6af21a2b0bbaa48c01d67c03fb49d.mp4?t=1755589106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They grab things, they flop and wobble (It adds to their personality)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Brawls, races, team games. From \u201cfriendly\u201d competitions to absolute chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>(SOME) LAWS OF PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are more of a recommendation but still they are simulated and applied here to everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COUCH AND ONLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're right next to each other or you\u2019re separated by the sea you get to slingshot bombs in your faces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDMADE VISUALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything looks like it was built in a playroom from clay (because it was).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EASY TO PLAY, IMPOSSIBLE TO MASTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong>Unless you\u2019re some kind of Mewt-whisperer. Then we\u2019re scared of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get your friends and wiggle your way to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In <strong>Slingball</strong> you try to get a ball in a goal using your stretching and visceral assault of other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In <strong>Brawl</strong> it\u2019s just the assault of other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In <strong>King of the Hill</strong> **you risk everything to be the one collecting the points but everyone gets to bully you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In <strong>Race</strong> you uh, well, assault other players and also race. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 And in <strong>Greedy Mewts</strong> teams compete in how many balls they get to steal for themselves.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939660?t=1755589106","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939660?t=1755589106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/a417902820962c4580dc0b959505ba7df5d8e1df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755589106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/a417902820962c4580dc0b959505ba7df5d8e1df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755589106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description